::instructions

{dough} = (mixing bowl) + (water) + (precooked corn flour) + (salt)
    <mix, by hand> ?= no clumps and smooth but solid
(pan) + (oil)
(pan) <preheat, low heat>
Repeat [
    {dough} <take, a piece>
        <form, into a palm-sized ball>
    {ball} <slap, carefully side to side into a disc> ?= neither too thick nor too thin
]
until all dough is shaped
